WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:06.520
Ruler of the majestic land, reside 
in my eye and give me your power!

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:07.950
Xyz Summon!

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:13.060
Appear, the ultimate armor 
that deflects everything!

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:17.330
Rank 6 C/C/C Rock Armor of Battle!

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:20.770
I knew you'd do that, so I have a plan ready!

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.000
I activate Rock Armor's effect.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.530
By using one Overlay Unit,

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:31.980
half the defense points of all Earth 
Attribute monsters are added to its attack points!

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.080
Let's battle!

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.210
Rock Armor attacks Gadget Giant!

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.820
I won't let you!

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:41.480
When Gadget Giant battles 
a Special Summoned monster,

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:44.660
it destroys it without damage calculation!

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.630
That's Tatsuya's secret plan!

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:48.590
Layra is in a pinch!

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:53.280
When Rock Armor battles an Earth 
monster, it negates its effects.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.330
What?

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:02.880
A huge comeback!

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:06.240
After Fusion and Synchro, 
he also Xyz Summoned!

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:10.680
The amazing newcomer Layra has 
conquered the Junior Class!

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:13.130
Congratulations.

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:17.020
Since you use three summoning 
methods, you're like Reiji Akaba.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:19.840
Thank you.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:26.870
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:32.080
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:35.110
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:39.360
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:42.100
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.770
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:47.570
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:58.680
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:04.150
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:09.760
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:13.890
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:17.830
Repeating Up/Down

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:20.170
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:27.440
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.880
Because I don't want to give up

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:35.880
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:42.960
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:53.470
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:56.170
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:58.870
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:01.680
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.450
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:12.940
Smile by Dueling

00:03:26.150 --> 00:03:28.520
Here I go!  It's my turn!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:33.020
I set the Pendulum Scale

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:38.570
with Scale 1 Abyss Actor - Evil Heel and 
Scale 8 Abyss Actor - Funky Comedian!

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:44.900
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.820
Pendulum Summon!

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:52.400
Appear, Level 7 Abyss Actor - Superstar!

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:58.080
Once per turn, Superstar allows me to add 
Abyss Script from my deck to my hand!

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:02.550
I activate Abyss Script - Fantasy 
Magic that I added to my hand!

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:06.620
Superstar will play the role 
that it reads in the script!

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:09.130
Let's battle!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:12.500
Superstar attacks Triple 
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.740
Weren't you watching, intruder?

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:21.820
Even if you destroy it, you'll 
take the counterattack combo.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.770
I didn't destroy it.

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:29.580
When Fantasy Magic activates, your battling 
monsters return to your hand that turn.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:33.050
But a Fusion Monster doesn't 
return to your hand.

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.730
It returns to your Extra Deck!

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:35.940
I activate a trap!

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.530
Ancient Gear Reverse Fusion!

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:44.260
When your card's effect causes my 
Ancient Gear to leave the field...

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:50.730
...I can Special Summon a Fusion Monster 
that requires that monster to Fusion Summon!

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:57.360
Appear, Level 9 Ultimate 
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:04.060
When it's Fusion Summoned, all 
your life points are halved!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.980
That's not fair!

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:09.560
Damn!

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:10.620
Stay back!

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:13.600
You stay back!

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.860
My turn!

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:20.460
Penalty for intruding: 2000 points.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.220
My turn.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.940
I activate the Continuous Spell Toy Vendor!

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:40.570
Once per turn, I send a card in my hand to 
the graveyard to draw a card from my deck.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.190
I send Fluffal Wings to my graveyard.

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:49.240
If I draw a Level 4-or-below 
monster, I can Special Summon it.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.260
If not, it goes to the graveyard.

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:56.670
I drew Level 3 Fluffal Bear, 
so I Special Summon it!

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:01.340
I activate the spell card Polymerization!

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.270
Fusion Summon!

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:08.580
Appear, the hair-raising beast 
that slashes everything!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.850
Frightfur Bear!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.780
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.380
Bring it on, Yuya.

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:20.520
I'll show you my true power.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:24.430
I'll make you smile for real again!

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:26.260
My turn!

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:34.560
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:41.250
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:44.210
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.930
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:50.020
Pendulum Summon!  Come out!

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:54.720
The heroic one with beautiful 
different-colored eyes!

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.330
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.500
Remember the first time we dueled!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:04.500
I was fooling around back then.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.470
I won't be so lame anymore.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:10.010
Your smile back then was real!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:13.450
Battle!  Odd-Eyes attacks Frightfur Bear!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:18.370
The Action Spell Flame Chain!

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:21.890
Your monster loses 400 attack points!

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:24.620
Stargazer Magician's Pendulum effect!

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:29.530
Once per turn, when my 
Pendulum Monster battles,

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:32.700
a spell card's activation 
and effects are negated!

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:34.640
Horoscope Divination!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.530
The Action Spell Flame Surge!

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:49.040
One monster gains 400 attack 
points during this turn!

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:53.100
The Quick-Play Spell De-Fusion!

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:55.450
I return Frightfur Bear to my Extra Deck.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:08:00.220
I Special Summon the two Fusion Material 
Monsters from the graveyard in defense position!

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:04.030
Odd-Eyes, attack Edge Imp Sabres!

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:09.420
When I destroy your defense 
position monster in battle,

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.300
Flame Surge deals damage 
equal to its defense points!

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:16.760
I end my turn.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:22.560
Flame Surge's effect ends, and Odd-Eyes's 
attack points return to normal.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:29.850
We battled like this before 
and became friends!

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:33.460
Become friends by dueling?

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.690
That's what I mean by lame!

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:43.830
Yuzu, I'll use the card you gave 
me so we can keep fighting!

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:50.510
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 
1 Red Fiend and Scale 12 Black Sun!

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:57.250
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 11 simultaneously!

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.710
Pendulum Summon!

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:00.220
Appear!

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:03.480
Two Superheavy Samurai Thieves!

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.650
And Superheavy Samurai Transporter!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:07.980
Superheavy Samurai Thief's effect!

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.950
By tributing this card,

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:14.300
I add a spell or trap card to my hand 
that activated in a previous turn!

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:19.760
Sawatari's Evil Heel is a spell card 
when it's in the Pendulum Zone,

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:21.570
so I add it to my hand!

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:24.100
You're using it wrong!

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:27.310
You should use that effect to 
break the opponent's combo!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.640
No, this is fine.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:32.500
I tribute the other Thief.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.950
I add Funky Comedian to my hand!

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:43.500
Then I tribute Transporter to add Evil Heel 
and Funky Comedian to Kurosaki's hand!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:47.160
Why did you give me the Pendulum Cards?

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:49.250
So you can finish this.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.670
I end my turn!

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:00.280
A duel is a battle!

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:02.740
It's either defeat or be defeated!

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:05.710
You're saying that we're no longer friends?

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:10.190
That's right.  I have something 
more important than friendship!

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.990
My turn!

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:23.620
So you can finish this.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.320
How lame.

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:33.720
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Evil Heel and Scale 8 Funky Comedian!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:40.280
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:44.920
Pendulum Summon!  Flock together!

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:50.630
Raidraptor - Wild Vultures!

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:55.030
I overlay three Level 6 Wild Vultures!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:05.510
Proud falcon, flap your wings that 
are stained with the blood of heroes

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:08.340
and travel the path of revolution!

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.380
Xyz Summon!

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:11.950
Appear!

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:16.820
Rank 6 Raidraptor - Revolution Falcon!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.630
I activate Revolution Falcon's effect!

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:27.630
By using one Overlay Unit, it 
can attack all your monsters!

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:31.600
Even if you attack, our 
combo will strike you back!

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:36.120
When this card battles a 
Special Summoned monster,

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:39.570
your monster's attack and 
defense points become 0!

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:42.050
Battle, Revolution Falcon!

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:49.580
Carry out the will of the fallen 
and annihilate all our enemies!

00:11:50.300 --> 00:11:52.880
Revolutional Air Raid!

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:03.240
How'd you like that!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.510
Oh yes!

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:12.660
I'll show you that winning is more 
important than friendship for me!

00:12:14.430 --> 00:12:16.010
My turn!

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:18.780
Due to Toy Vendor's effect,

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:23.150
I send Fluffal Wings in my hand 
to the graveyard to draw one card!

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:27.790
If I draw a Level 4-or-below 
monster, I can Special Summon it.

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:34.300
I drew Level 2 Fluffal Owl, 
so I Special Summon it!

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:38.890
When I successfully summon it from my hand,

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:42.970
I can add the spell card Polymerization 
from my deck to my hand!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.930
When Toy Vendor is on my field,

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:48.850
I can activate Fluffal Wings's 
effect from my graveyard.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:53.410
By banishing two copies, I can 
draw two cards from my deck!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:57.380
And by tributing Toy Vendor, 
I can draw one card!

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:02.220
He drew three cards?

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:05.440
I activate the Continuous 
Spell Edge Nightmare!

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:11.200
Once per turn, I Special Summon a Level 
4-or-below Edge Imp from my graveyard!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.870
Edge Imp Sabres!

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:16.280
I activate the spell card Polymerization

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:20.670
to fuse Edge Imp Sabres, 
Fluffal Bear and Fluffal Owl!

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:24.750
Devil's claws, beast's 
fangs and purgatory's eyes!

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.970
Become one in the whirlpool of mystery!

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:29.520
Show your new power and look!

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:31.680
Fusion Summon!

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:36.930
Appear, the magical forest beast 
that tears through everything!

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:39.640
Frightfur Tiger!

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.640
Wake up, Sora!

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:46.070
You taught Yuzu how to Fusion 
Summon because of friendship!

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:48.260
I shouldn't have done that.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.940
Fusion Summon is too priceless.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.770
It's the power to unite the world into one!

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:56.780
Using power to unite the world is wrong!

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:58.510
It's not wrong!

00:13:58.510 --> 00:14:01.470
When Frightfur Tiger is Fusion Summoned,

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:05.250
it destroys one of your cards 
for every Fusion Material!

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.750
So it destroys three cards!

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:12.060
And for every Fluffal and 
Frightfur monster on my field,

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:17.050
Frightfur Tiger gains 300 attack points!

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:21.970
Let's battle.

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:24.670
Frightfur Tiger attacks you directly!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:38.330
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:41.420
I bet that hurt, Yuya.

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:44.650
Why have you changed so much?

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:48.130
You're more innocent and cheerful.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.740
This is my true self.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.870
I'm Academia's duel warrior!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.940
Academia?  Whatever!

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:57.510
My turn!

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:00.710
I summon Performapal Skeeter Skimmer!

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:04.320
When I summon a Performapal,

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:07.980
I can Special Summon Performapal 
Secondonkey from my hand!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:12.490
I overlay Level 4 Skeeter 
Skimmer and Secondonkey!

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.920
Xyz Summon!

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:20.290
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:28.050
Don't you know what Academia 
did in the Xyz Dimension?

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:34.350
You stomped all over Heartland, a peaceful 
city that was overflowing with smiles!

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:35.960
It couldn't be helped.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.290
It's to unite the world into one.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.880
You have no right to do that!

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:43.130
I activate Dark Rebellion's effect!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:46.250
By using one Overlay Unit, 
until the end of the turn...

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:51.200
...the attack points of your Level 
5-or-above monster are halved,

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:54.670
and this card gains those attack points!

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.970
Remember your true self, Sora!

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.970
I said that this is my true self!

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:03.470
The Counter Trap Frightfur March!

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:09.480
When your monster's effect targets my 
Frightfur Fusion Monster, that effect is negated.

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:15.150
Then I send a Frightfur in my Extra Deck with 
the same Level as the target to the graveyard.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:20.720
Then I Special Summon a Fusion 
Monster from my Extra Deck

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:23.360
that uses the target as Fusion Material!

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:28.110
Appear, the wicked wild 
beast that bites everything!

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:30.200
Frightfur Sabre-Tooth!

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:39.160
When it's Fusion Summoned, I can Special 
Summon one Frightfur from my graveyard!

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:43.240
Appear, the hair-raising beast 
that slashes everything!

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:45.410
Frightfur Bear!

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:49.320
When Frightfur Tiger is faceup,

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:55.700
Frightfurs gain 300 attack points for 
every Fluffal and Frightfur on my field!

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:59.950
And when Sabre-Tooth is faceup,

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:06.730
Frightfurs gain 400 attack points for 
every Fluffal and Frightfur on my field!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.500
Damn!  This isn't enough!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:21.020
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 3 
Xiangke Magician and Scale 8 Xiangsheng Magician!

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:31.020
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 4 and 7 simultaneously!

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:33.840
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:36.510
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.750
Pendulum Summon!  Come out!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.280
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:49.650
Odd-Eyes again.

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:54.730
When a Pendulum Monster is destroyed, it 
goes to the Extra Deck instead of the graveyard.

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.420
That's how you beat me last time.

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:59.150
Xiangke Magician's Pendulum effect!

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:06.170
Once per turn, a Xyz Monster 
gets a Level equal to its Rank!

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:14.200
I change Rank 4 Dark Rebellion to Level 4!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.270
A Xyz Monster has a Level?

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:23.180
Xiangsheng Magician's Pendulum effect!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:29.560
Once per turn, a monster's Level becomes 
the same as another monster's Level!

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:33.640
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's 
Level becomes the same

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:37.000
as Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon's, 
making it Level 7!

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:40.370
He now has two Level 7 monsters.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.850
Ute, I know you're here.

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:50.050
You said to make people smile by 
dueling, and I believe in you.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:53.740
I'll duel to make Sora smile again!

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:57.990
I overlay Level 7 Odd-Eyes 
and Dark Rebellion!

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:07.970
Dragon with different-colored eyes, 
exterminate your enemies with your black wrath!

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:09.820
Xyz Summon!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.250
Come out, Rank 7!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:18.580
With shining eyes of fury!  
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:25.370
Since I used Level 7 Dark Rebellion 
to summon Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon...

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:29.050
...all your Level 7-or-below 
monsters are destroyed,

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:31.610
and you take damage equal 
to their attack points!

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:34.930
The Continuous Trap Fusion Fortress!

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:40.090
When there's a Fusion Monster on 
my field, effect damage is negated!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:44.360
Since Frightfur Tiger left 
the field, its effect ends.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:49.060
Sabre-Tooth's effect also changes because 
there are fewer Frightfur monsters.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:51.030
Yuya!

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:01.240
How fun, Yuya!

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:04.040
A Xyz Pendulum Monster!

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:07.480
That's why your duels always excite me!

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:08.360
That's right!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.340
Dueling is fun.

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:14.690
That's why you have to stop fighting!

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:19.560
I activate Odd-Eyes Rebellion's effect!

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:25.980
By using one Overlay Unit, it can attack 
for every monster it destroyed this turn!

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:29.050
Let's battle!

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:31.870
Odd-Eyes Rebellion attacks Sabre-Tooth!

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:34.070
The Action Spell Flame Chain!

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:38.310
Your monster loses 400 attack points!

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:40.410
The Action Spell Flame Surge!

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:44.150
One monster gains 400 attack points!

00:20:56.700 --> 00:21:01.100
Time's up for the battle royal!

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:04.960
Yuya!  Sora!

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:06.760
Gongenzaka!

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:08.930
Yuzu?

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:19.250
Yuzu Hiiragi!  How dare you make goo-goo 
eyes at my darling while hitting on another man!

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.440
I'm not Yuzu.

00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:24.690
Then where's Yuzu?

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:28.670
I looked for her, but I only found this girl.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:30.910
Can it be?

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.040
Sora!

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:40.240
I watched your duels.

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:42.440
Reiji Akaba!

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:44.250
You've come at the right time.

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:48.600
Just like you wanted, I chased Academia away.

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:52.740
That means I can be a Lancer, right?

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:54.920
Lancer?  What's that?

00:21:55.680 --> 00:22:00.290
This battle royal was a test 
to select duel warriors.

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:01.310
Test?

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:32.880
As long as there's a smile

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:39.650
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:42.080 --> 00:22:44.950
I always believe

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:48.490
In my tomorrow

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:54.100
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:22:57.360 --> 00:23:02.740
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:02.740 --> 00:23:09.610
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:16.280
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:16.820 --> 00:23:20.350
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:45.080 --> 00:23:48.320
You've successfully repelled Academia.

00:23:48.320 --> 00:23:55.000
You've proven your strength to become 
Lancers, my ideal duel warriors.

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:58.800
That's why you made us fight?

00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:02.120
You caused Yuzu to turn into a card!

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:05.920
I don't care about the Lancers!  
Bring everyone back!

00:24:06.680 --> 00:24:11.200
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Lancers  Chosen Warriors

00:24:11.200 --> 00:24:13.480
The fun is only getting started!
